# Direct Python dependencies for the live Sign2Text runtime â€” CPU-only profile.
# Use this file on machines WITHOUT an NVIDIA GPU.
#
# For NVIDIA/CUDA machines, use requirements.runtime.in instead.
#
# Verified against the checked-in .venv on Python 3.11.9.
#
# Runtime app paths covered here:
# - backend/api_server.py
# - backend/new_Inference.py
# - backend/stt_backend.py
# - backend/tts_backend.py
# - backend/translate.py
# - start.py
#
# Intentionally excluded from the live-app runtime set:
# - offline keypoint-extraction and model-training tooling: maintained
#   privately, not published in this repository. Needs additional packages
#   such as pandas and tensorboard.
# - tests/: pytest-only dependencies. Use requirements.test.txt for validation.
#
# Environment/system requirements still outside pip:
# - external ASL checkpoint file
# - local webcam access
# - Ollama service + model
# - Google/Azure credentials
#
# NOTE: rtmlib 0.0.15 declares a dependency on "onnxruntime".  The plain
# (CPU) onnxruntime package satisfies that dependency natively, so no
# compatibility metapackage is needed for the CPU profile.
#
# PyTorch CPU wheels are distributed from the official PyTorch wheel index.
# Keeping the extra index explicit here makes fresh-machine installs
# reproducible without relying on per-user pip configuration.

--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu

